  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven :56 + (11 × 2) – (52 ÷ 4) + 16 = 76\n\nOption 1) 16 and 11\n\n56 + (11 × 2) – (52 ÷ 4) + 16 = 76 ⇒ 56 + (16 × 2) – (52 ÷ 4) + 11 = 76\n\n⇒ 56 + __**(16**____** × 2)**__ – __**(52 ÷ 4)**__ + 11 = 76\n\n⇒ __**56 + 32**____** + 11**__ – 13 = 76\n\n⇒ __**99 - 13**__ = 76\n\n⇒ 86 ≠ 76 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 56 and 52\n\n56 + (11 × 2) – (52 ÷ 4) + 16 = 76 ⇒ 52 + (11 × 2) – (56 ÷ 4) + 16 = 76\n\n⇒ 52 + __**(11 × 2)**__ – __**(56 ÷ 4)**__ + 16 = 76\n\n⇒ __**52 + 22 + 16**__ – 14 = 76\n\n⇒ __**90 - 14**__ = 76\n\n**⇒ 76 = 76 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) 2 and 4\n\n56 + (11 × 2) – (52 ÷ 4) + 16 = 76 ⇒ 56 + (11 × 4) – (52 ÷ 2) + 16 = 76\n\n⇒ 56 + __**(11 × 4)**__ – __**(52 ÷ 2)**__ + 16 = 76\n\n⇒ __**56 + 44 + 16**__ – 26 = 76\n\n⇒ __**116 - 26**__ = 76\n\n⇒ 90 ≠ 76 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 52 and 16\n\n56 + (11 × 2) – (52 ÷ 4) + 16 = 76 ⇒ 56 + (11 × 2) – (16 ÷ 4) + 16 = 52\n\n⇒ 56 + __**(11 × 2)**__ – __**(16 ÷ 4)**__ + 16 = 52\n\n⇒ __**56 + 22 + 16**__ – 4 = 52\n\n⇒ __**94 - 4**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 90 ≠ 52 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
